  <h1>Price vs. <span>User Rating</span><br>Trend Analysis, 2009–2019</h1>
  <div class="subtitle">A decade of Amazon bestseller data examined across 550 annual entries — does what customers pay predict how satisfied they are?</div>
  <div class="meta-row">
    <span class="meta-tag">550 Book Entries</span>
